---
description: >-
  a name or text value written as a markdown string ("`…`") is read as
  markdown; without backticks bold and italic are drawn as written, and so is
  a code span inside plain text (D731, #1368; was #763, D564)
---
requirementDiagram
requirement "`**bold**`" {
id: 1
text: "`*it*`"
}
requirement "**strong** name" {
id: 2
text: "- not a *bullet*"
}
element "`code` element" {
type: "`sim`"
}
